			subtitle: "Warning: The first two times you sleep a dream event is triggered, do not hit any mobs in the dream dimension otherwise you will die in your dream and be stuck underground."
			description: ["After being framed for an unspeakable crime, you have been banished to a planet on the farthest edge of the universe, exiled from all known space-faring civilizations. After years of isolation and anger towards those that framed you, you decide to explore the planet further and perhaps see if there are any locals. The desire to build a civilization and show those who have wronged you grows, and you now embark on a journey to show them their mistakes."]
